02:08.440 --> 02:14.240
And in terms of Kirsten, like, we connected through Instagram and started sharing ideas

02:14.240 --> 02:20.160
in the last bull cycle, especially around altcoins, the wins, the losses, the fun of

02:20.160 --> 02:20.340
it.

02:20.620 --> 02:25.980
And we also connected over CypherB because we were both using CypherB and MarketCypher.

02:26.140 --> 02:29.020
And that's kind of how we connected and joined forces.

02:29.020 --> 02:29.460
Nice.

02:31.280 --> 02:33.800
And how about you, Kirsten?

02:34.740 --> 02:38.460
Yeah, for me, my brother actually worked at an investment bank.

02:38.720 --> 02:40.680
So he's two years older than me, right?

02:40.800 --> 02:45.280
So when I was 19, he said that there was like a part-time job just going there.

02:45.620 --> 02:47.960
Nothing sexy, of course, just customer service.

02:48.620 --> 02:53.140
But when I was at the bank, he had friends that were on the trading desk.

02:53.320 --> 02:55.240
And that's the first time I ever saw that.

02:55.740 --> 02:58.340
And I said to him, I want to do that.

02:58.340 --> 03:01.100
